Indeed I am.

52
00:03:24,820 --> 00:03:26,937
You're a bit out of your
elements, Straw Hat.

53
00:03:27,020 --> 00:03:28,317
Even though you're a rookie,

54
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:31,871
I expected more from a pirate
with a bounty of 300 million.

55
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:35,657
Especially one who has caused the
world government so much trouble.

56
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:36,916
Speaking of trouble,

57
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:42,021
I can't imagine how you managed to worm
your way through security, but here you are.

58
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:47,357
Rest assured, you will suffer
for tarnishing my reputation.

59
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:49,637
I know why you're here, by the way!

60
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:51,602
You came to rescue your brother,

61
00:03:51,780 --> 00:03:52,737
Portgas D .A.,

62
00:03:52,820 --> 00:03:54,757
2nd Division Commander of the Whitebeard

63
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:57,428
Pirates You've had quite
the little rampage,

64
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:59,637
but all of that will come to an end now.

65
