Magellan's whole body is poisonous.

71
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:19,937
Crazy, terrible poison.

72
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:22,177
If you so much as touch
him, you're finished!

73
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:25,080
You can't bait a guy like that. I will.

74
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:27,977
Let's go back the way we came.

75
00:04:28,060 --> 00:04:29,637
To the pool of blood.

76
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:32,197
This way, give up on that stupid food.

77
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:34,221
And let's hightail it to level 5.

78
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:35,680
There's no escape!

79
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:42,857
The staircase to level 5 is protected by
three demon guards and their commander.

80
00:04:42,940 --> 00:04:48,077
Every exit on this floor has
already been accounted for.

81
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,277
There will be no more running.

82
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,120
This is your?

83
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:53,717
No!

84
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,897
I won't believe it!

85
00:04:54,980 --> 00:04:56,098
I can't believe it!

86
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:02,330
Hydra!

87
00:05:06,860 --> 00:05:08,360
What the heck is that?

88
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:09,960
A venom monster?

89
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,380
Thing is poison?

90
00:05:19,140 --> 00:05:20,977
Warden Magellan, wait, please.

91
00:05:21,060 --> 00:05:22,413
We're still evacuating.

92
00:05:26,580 --> 00:05:29,060
The warden guy's poisoning his own people.

93
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:32,957
The hydrous venom is a
paralytic neuron, Johnson.

94
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,857
It makes its way through your body.

95
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:37,587
Causing horrific pain
before you finally die.

96
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:41,357
It's killing me.

97
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:42,780
Give me the antidote.

98
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,880
Hurry! Boss, why?

99
00:05:45,380 --> 00:05:48,377
Stay out of the way when I'm
fighting, you damn fools.

100
00:05:48,460 --> 00:05:49,290
You got that?

101
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:51,089
We're terribly sorry, sir.

102
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:52,340
Stop chasing me.

103
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:53,497
I just want to eat.

104
00:05:53,580 --> 00:05:55,957
How do you think about
food in a time like this?

105
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:58,537
Either way, you've got to respect
a man that knows what he wants.

106
00:05:58,620 --> 00:06:00,680
I admire your bravery, dear friend.

107
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:03,449
It just sucks that
we're both going to die.

108
00:06:08,740 --> 00:06:10,620
Touch me if you can, Hydra!

109
