How clever.

113
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:24,381
You have some of your
brother's cunning after all.

114
00:06:32,660 --> 00:06:33,601
Chloroform ball!

115
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:38,720
That was close!

116
00:06:40,740 --> 00:06:42,377
Put your gas masks on!

117
00:06:42,460 --> 00:06:43,360
Stay clear.

118
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:45,917
The warden's in the middle of a battle.

119
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,860
What is this? Sear gas?

120
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,200
No, it's Magellan's poison.

121
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:52,852
Go somewhere else to fight, you bastards.

122
00:06:53,180 --> 00:06:54,768
Who's he up against anyway?

123
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:56,220
I don't know.

124
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:58,437
Maybe that intruder
they were talking about.

125
00:06:58,520 --> 00:07:00,460
So hell heat plus poison gas?

126
00:07:00,700 --> 00:07:01,800
Give me a break.

127
