My eyes, it's like crazy.

128
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,480
What's happening to me?

129
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:13,560
I can't fight!

130
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,660
Fight like this?

131
