Whoa, the Hydra!

132
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:22,280
Stop moving!

133
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:28,120
Down the Venom road.

134
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:30,780
Try as you might.

135
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:39,710
Oh!

136
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:57,112
One touch and it's over.

137
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:03,224
He's melting through the stone.

138
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,720
First the wall, and then you.

139
00:08:07,740 --> 00:08:09,800
I've gotta rescue Ace!

140
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:13,680
Surely, even you must know
that your death is imminent.

141
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,940
Just like Ace.

142
00:08:27,380 --> 00:08:32,520
