while Magellan is busy with Straw Hat!

143
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:33,837
Are you out of your mind?

144
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:37,220
Look how many gods there
are down there. It's nuts.

145
00:08:37,460 --> 00:08:38,636
That doesn't matter.

146
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:39,917
Just think about it.

147
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:44,617
They assign the more powerful demon guards
to protect the staircase to level five.

148
00:08:44,700 --> 00:08:49,257
It's more important to them to not let
Straw Hat get down to the lower levels.

149
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:52,720
Meaning they are the crappiest
security they have here.

150
00:08:53,700 --> 00:08:57,406
If we miss this chance, soon
after they'll time their defenses.

151
00:08:57,740 --> 00:08:59,737
Straw Hat will lose at some point.

152
00:08:59,820 --> 00:09:01,517
Once he does, this window is closed.

153
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:04,297
We must get to level
three before that happens.

154
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:08,277
Actually, maybe you're right.

155
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:12,877
I've never heard anything about Vice Warden
Hannibal having any Devil Fruit powers.

156
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:19,477
If I can take out those guards
with a muggy ball, we can do it.

157
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:22,997
Hannibal can't be that tough
right now. You're thinking?

158
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,837
All right, let's do it.

159
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:26,097
I don't want to stay in.

160
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:27,597
this heat one moment longer.

161
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,739
It's now or never.

162
00:09:30,220 --> 00:09:31,050
Ready?

163
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:39,697
Nothing is going to stop
us from getting through.

164
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:40,610
That's right.

165
00:09:40,693 --> 00:09:41,735
Vice Warden Hannibal.

166
00:09:41,820 --> 00:09:43,497
Look, it's Buggy the Clown and Mr.

167
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:44,410
Three.

168
00:09:44,493 --> 00:09:45,797
Looks like they're trying
to get to level three.

169
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:47,477
We can't let those bastards go any higher.

170
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,390
Let's go.

171
00:09:48,473 --> 00:09:51,600
Now, McGee! Can do! Wait a minute!

172
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:55,160
Guards, stand down.

173
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:08,060
No, come, come!

174
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:09,800
Oh, damn!

175
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:24,297
Warden Magellan guards the
most dangerous criminals

176
00:10:24,380 --> 00:10:27,580
in the most infamous
prison in the entire world.

177
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:31,060
He's the lord and master of hell itself.

178
00:10:31,620 --> 00:10:34,973
You're not going to let Strawboy
face him alone, are you?

179
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:40,120
Oh, forgive me.

180
00:10:44,340 --> 00:10:46,760
There's just no way to meet him.

181
00:10:47,140 --> 00:10:49,787
I tried to warn you,
but you wouldn't listen.

182
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:52,080
Running is the only answer.

183
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:55,120
I'm sorry, Strawboy. I'm a coward.

184
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,320
Forgive me.

185
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:02,900
I suggest you put an end to
this nonsense and submit.

186
00:11:08,060 --> 00:11:13,020
I'm going to rescue my brother, and
we'll escape from here together.

187
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:17,480
I won't die without even seeing him.

188
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:24,080
And I'm not going to let you
execute him, you hear me?

189
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,460
What's that smoke?

190
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:29,557
I don't have time for your tricks.

191
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:31,111
I'm not getting anywhere.

192
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:34,020
I can't win without touching you.

193
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:37,340
I'll make a sacrifice.

194
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:43,880
You can take my arms, but I won't lose

195
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:49,380
Why would I need your arms?

196
00:11:49,700 --> 00:11:52,347
You want me to take you
apart piece by piece?

197
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:57,800
Oh, gong gong!

198
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:00,960
Jet bazooka!

199
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:37,500
Morons, what's wrong with you two?

200
00:12:38,500 --> 00:12:41,324
If you had just slipped
away when I told you to,

201
00:12:41,420 --> 00:12:44,008
I could have blamed
this mess on the warden.

202
00:12:45,620 --> 00:12:47,677
We're at the staircase to level three.

203
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,617
There was a raid by two of the escapees.

204
00:12:49,700 --> 00:12:51,524
We've got some casualties here.

205
00:12:51,660 --> 00:12:52,717
Yes, that's right.

206
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:54,297
We have Buggy the Clown and Mr.

207
00:12:54,380 --> 00:12:55,380
Three in custody.

208
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,757
You wanted to go through the gate.

209
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:02,252
I said fine, but you wouldn't believe me.

210
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:04,140
Ruin my plan.

211
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,030
Ow.

212
00:13:06,113 --> 00:13:08,920
He's a hell of a lot
stronger than he looks.

213
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,560
Damn Hannibal.

214
00:13:11,500 --> 00:13:16,640
I don't want to be tortured if
that's what's in store for me.

215
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:19,460
I'm going to bite off my tongue.

216
00:13:21,380 --> 00:13:22,617
I'm serious.

217
00:13:22,700 --> 00:13:23,920
Here I go.

218
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,420
I'm going to do it.

219
00:13:25,620 --> 00:13:27,740
I'm really going to do it.

220
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:39,120
There's no way we can beat Magellan.

221
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:43,520
I'm not gonna dream an impossible dream.

222
00:13:44,620 --> 00:13:50,020
If I'd remain there any longer, I'm
200 % sure he would have killed me.

223
00:13:51,460 --> 00:13:52,637
Don't look back.

224
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,779
Just keep running.

225
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,860
The only thing I can do is run.

226
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:12,060
It would seem you have
brought me to my knees, boy.

227
00:14:14,560 --> 00:14:18,300
Even a cornered rabbit will
fight with teeth and claws.

228
00:14:22,340 --> 00:14:26,500
But now, your hands and arms
are covered in my poison.

229
00:14:30,620 --> 00:14:32,300
You're feeling the pain.

230
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:34,000
I know you are.

231
00:14:34,140 --> 00:14:36,920
Now come go!

232
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,960
Twins it for kill!

233
00:14:45,140 --> 00:14:46,020
Venom!

234
00:14:48,140 --> 00:14:49,540
Glowfish!

235
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:04,300
See you like this!

236
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:06,220
Gum-Gum! Hydra!

237
00:15:09,580 --> 00:15:11,100
Ten pistol!

238
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:28,680
Fuck!

239
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:09,560
Vision getting blurry?

240
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:12,080
Are your ears ringing?

241
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:16,600
Your hands have become
useless, haven't they?

242
00:16:19,780 --> 00:16:24,940
In time, my poison will
take everything from you.

243
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:38,020
Hey, Jailor.

244
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:40,860
Want to do a condemned man a favor?

245
00:16:42,060 --> 00:16:45,940
Tell me, is something
happening on the upper levels?

246
00:16:49,540 --> 00:16:51,020
No, not a thing.

247
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:06,040
No, come, come!

248
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:07,850
Stop!

249
00:17:15,820 --> 00:17:17,720
Are you finally done?

250
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:30,917
No!

251
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,520
Second gear!

252
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,400
Hydra!

253
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:51,600
My wife!

254
00:17:52,280 --> 00:17:53,920
My brother!

255
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:10,220
Consider this your punishment, child.

256
00:18:11,740 --> 00:18:16,457
There's no way to neutralize the amount
of poison your body has absorbed.

257
00:18:16,540 --> 00:18:22,940
You will suffer an agonizing pain
for 24 hours, and then you will die.

258
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:25,220
This is true hell.

259
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:36,440
Warden Magellan!

260
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,080
Excellent battle, sir.

261
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,797
What should we do with Luffy?

262
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:40,710
Any orders?

263
00:18:40,793 --> 00:18:43,797
He'll die soon, but we don't
want him just lying there.

264
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:47,960
