That guy's been missing for ages.

517
00:33:23,120 --> 00:33:24,577
What do you even want with him?

518
00:33:24,660 --> 00:33:26,397
And how did you get out of your cell?

519
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:27,892
Get me out of mine, too!

520
00:33:32,860 --> 00:33:35,684
Do you know why they're
keeping a man named Eva?

521
00:33:36,300 --> 00:33:42,880
Hey, you! What's wrong? Hey! Speak up!
Answer me! Don't bother. Didn't you notice?

522
00:33:43,060 --> 00:33:45,295
Everyone in that cell is frozen stiff.

523
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:48,840
How about you, then?

524
00:33:49,940 --> 00:33:51,500
Yeah, I heard you.

525
00:33:51,960 --> 00:33:53,997
Said you're looking for Ivankov, right?

526
00:33:54,080 --> 00:33:54,910
Yeah.

527
00:33:54,993 --> 00:33:55,823
Do you know something?

528
00:33:55,906 --> 00:33:57,080
Look, over there.

529
00:33:57,340 --> 00:33:59,080
You see that forest? Yes.

530
00:33:59,800 --> 00:34:03,280
There's an abandoned jailhouse,
way beyond the tree line.

531
00:34:04,260 --> 00:34:08,420
A while back, I saw this strange
guy just dancing around out there.

532
00:34:09,040 --> 00:34:09,870
Really?

533
00:34:09,980 --> 00:34:11,451
Yeah, I think it was him.

534
00:34:11,780 --> 00:34:12,839
It's worth a look.

535
00:34:15,160 --> 00:34:16,100
Thanks, friend.

536
00:34:16,560 --> 00:34:18,148
We're all in this together.

537
00:34:19,280 --> 00:34:23,380
That forest, it's where
the wolves live. Oh, is it?

538
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:31,117
We believe that those missing have
been dragged to the gate of hell.

539
00:34:31,200 --> 00:34:33,360
Hence why we call it what we do.

540
00:34:34,060 --> 00:34:36,520
The gates of hell, demon-ing away.

541
00:34:37,040 --> 00:34:38,275
Quit pulling my tail.

542
00:34:38,560 --> 00:34:42,277
No way Eva disappeared because of
some superstitious mumbo-jumbo.

543
00:34:42,360 --> 00:34:45,737
I've never met him myself, but his
reputation certainly precedes him.

544
00:34:45,820 --> 00:34:49,657
Even in a hell like this place, I'm
sure he can still make a miracle happen.

545
00:34:49,740 --> 00:34:53,280
Because Eva is our queen, our god!

546
00:34:58,160 --> 00:35:04,160
Somehow I know he can save straw boy if
we can't count on an antidote anymore.

547
00:35:07,580 --> 00:35:09,540
He's his only chance.

548
00:35:13,100 --> 00:35:17,160
Eva I swear I'll find you no matter what.

549
00:35:34,680 --> 00:35:37,520
Oh, my God.

550
00:36:20,420 --> 00:36:21,620
Straw boy!

551
00:36:23,280 --> 00:36:28,300
What do you think you're
doing to my friend Bon?

552
00:36:29,160 --> 00:36:30,820
Leave him?

553
00:37:07,760 --> 00:37:11,700
Oh, straw boy, how did you?

554
00:37:34,080 --> 00:37:39,400
The public execution of Five Fist
Ace will take place in 26 hours.
